{
  "id": "2KI.24",
  "number": "24",
  "bookId": "2KI",
  "reference": "2 Sugoodiga 24",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda waseewa Yehoyakimu sugoocheanda, hean ghwascheang'da Nebukadinesa was sugoocheanda Babeli gawa Yuda. Ak ghoah Yehoyakimu siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda gweanyeew samwagu iidu ghwayam geaw ak ghwanung'wa heeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goojeakta NG'UTAMIIDA lugooda fuga Galdayo, ea Shaamu ea Moabu ea lugooda orjooga Amoni, ak goojeakta gaweay Yuda ghwanung' goosha gawuurji gidanyaashta ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA aba naweeda fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda was sibanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba huumwa ng'asheesu ghwanyas fuga Yuda aba gidarukuteayda NG'UTAMIIDA. Aba gideaba eang'aamwa madeadaanyi, aba riing'eega ghayi sin Manase, ea ng'asheega sean sin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba badayda foojeanda manda giidiinyeanda ghayi ahiida, aba gideaba ghoanyiit Yerusalemu foojeanda manda giidiinyeanda. Ak NG'UTAMIIDA ea miighamwas gwasamsa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'asheega sean sin Yehoyakimu heapi miyeeng'oorsa jeeda Gitaabooda damanyoojiga bea sugoodiga Yuda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghami Yehoyakimu ak geebung'sa heeda bung'eadinga ghweanigaaschi, ak gawa hoorgeadaanyi bea sugoocheanduumeeda orjeedaanyi was Yekoniya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iidu sugoocheanda Misri ea mutgabiigu gicha aba jeeda ng'eanyiidaanyi. Aba gideaba sugoocheanda Babeli niing'waay ng'eanyiida sugoocheanda Misri ghang'eada eenda Misri ea ghwahita eenda Furati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakini sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakini ghoang'waay sugoocheanduumeeda nea gaba gweanyeew damasis, ak ghwaak sheesamwagu aba Yerusalemu, gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Nehushta hudeaba Elinatani mida Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin ng'asheega munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, gawuurji gea ghayi sin ghwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba damandida ghwascheang'da fuga gadiyeeda bea Nebukadinesa was sugoocheanda Babeli ak gaweay Yerusalemu amang'ata geeneaweesa mujiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu Nebukadinesa was sugoocheanda Babeli gaweesa mujiini damanda neaweesiina fugaaschi bea gadiyeedean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean Yehoyakini was sugoocheanda Yuda gwarita ak gaweesa sugoocheanda Babeli, niny ea ghaamwat ea fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda, ea fugaaschi hees, ea fugaaschi hees bea gadiyeeda gheeda sugoocheanda. Hean ghoang'waay sugoocheanda Babeli niny ak gwajaksa ghealooniga gweanyeew sis, ak goombal ng'eanyiidaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gageanda haleanjeeda sean siitiiw bea gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea haleanjeeda siitiiw bea gheeda sugoocheanda, nea ghwalajaada haleanjeeda sean bea dahaabu, ghayi sin Sulemani was sugoocheanda Israeli mida jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA bea NG'UTAMIIDA gawuurji gidanyaashta NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwaat fuga sean bea Yerusalemu, fuga hees sean, ea fuga meanyi sean, fih sagalamnyooji damanamughuush, ea gearnoodiga sean, ea gidang'oodiga sean, manda siida siipuut, geaghus fuga ng'arng'ari bea ng'eanyiita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwaat Yehoyakini ea ghwahita Babeli; ea gheamata sugoocheanda ea gadeemga sugoocheanda, ea shirikarajeega hees, ea fuga hees bea ng'eanyiida. Ak ghwaat buuneeda ghang'eada Yerusalemu ea ghwahita Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga meanyi sean ea sagalamnyooji ispwa, gearnoodiga ea gidang'oodiga ea sagalam, ea fuga sean mideawa uurjeenga ea gea niimu ng'ucheeda suh seaniin ghwaat sugoocheanda Babeli ea ghwahita ng'eanyiida Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gageanu sugoocheanda Babeli Matani was orjeeda ghamaghweanda Yehoyakini, ak ghwanung' ghoah sugoocheanda gawa hoorgeadaanyi, nea ghwayam gheawungaaschi geeguura Sedekiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sedekiya sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sedekiya ghoang'waay sugoocheanduumeeda nea gaba gweanyeew diktam ea agi. Ak ghwaak gweanyeew damwanagi aba Yerusalemu. Gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Hamutali was hudeaba Yeremiya bea mujiineeda Libina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin gea munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gawuurji sean gea ghayi sin Yehoyakini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba nyarasta NG'UTAMIIDA, ghoah gidabuna ng'asheesu aba Yerusalemu ea Yuda, ak ghoah gidageandeawa ghoang'aamwa madeadaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu Sedekiya ghaheawa sugoocheanda Babeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
